# An allowlist: only what the image is built from. Everything else — the
# build output, node_modules, local notes, editor files — never enters the
# build, so nothing kept out of git can end up in an image by accident.
*
!gradlew
!gradle/
!settings.gradle
!build.gradle
!src/
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
**/.DS_Store
